{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51345","headline":"赏牡丹（句） · 李正封","name":"赏牡丹（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（唐文皇好诗，大和中赏牡丹，上谓程修己曰：「今京邑人传牡丹诗，谁爲首出？\n」对曰：「中书舍人李正封诗天番云云。\n」时杨妃侍，上曰：「妆台前宜饮以一紫金盏酒，则正封之诗见矣。\n」）天香夜染衣，国色朝酣酒。\n（《唐诗纪事》四十）（见《松窗杂录》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李正封","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}